  "applies_to": "SMT-770 thermostat (with or without a paired EC-02 module), communications addendum v4.6 for firmware 2.31.",
  "summary": "The Smart Temp SMT-770 is an Australian 24 V multifunction thermostat with an RS-485 Modbus RTU port; a paired EC-02 output module appears as the same device. This map covers relay coils, thermostat and fan modes, set temperatures, room temperature, network settings and the coil override.",
